  "releaseNotes": "* Fluent API: Added support for projecting results into records  (or classes without parameterless constructors)\n* Fluent API: Added support for using records (or classes without parameterless constructors) as document models\n* Fluent API: Added support for Sphinx' TDigest function \n* Fluent API: Added support for Manticore's Autocomplete function\n* Fluent API: References to weight() in binary expressions in SELECT do not get replaced by an alias of a weight column anymore. This was a limitation of earlier Sphinx versions (2.1.1 and below) and hasn't been necessary for quite some time now.\n* General: Bumped package references to non-vulnerable versions",
